tei:div.tei:p:
pra we sha ya phaṭa ces lus sgo phye: nṛ a be sha ya a (326)zhes brjod pa yis: rnam par shes pa a yig dngul chu'i mdog: lus la zhugs pas tshe 'das dngos gyur pa'i: snying gar ye shes rdo rje rtse lnga la: lte bar hūm̐ yig dkar pos mtshan pa la: dzaḥhūm̐ baṃ hoḥmi 'gyur rgyas btab gyur: rtse lnga'i rgya spyi bor bzhag lus la rdo rje'i go khrab zhu lubs su bkon par gyur: oṃ badz+ra ka la sha rak+ṣa rak+ṣa hūm̐: spyi bor rdo rje bzhag phyi rol rdo rje'i gur chen por gyur: badz+ra rak+ṣa rak+ṣa hūm̐: zhes brjod/ oṃ sarba big nan  sogs nas sbyong khrus/ dbang bskur/ phung khams skye mched yi dam lha yi ngo bor dag par gyur/ zhes (327)pa'i 'phros su/ oṃ āḥhūm̐/ 'gro ba rigs drug lam rgyud lnga  sogs kyis 'dod yon bsngo/ kye tshe las 'das pa byon cig  sogs nas  ma sngangs ma skrag par song zhig: rjes su bzang spyod sogs kyi smon lam gdab/ gtor bzlog phyin 'phang ba'i las rim ltar bya/ nub tha mar lam bstan rjes su/ byang bu'i rnam shes hūm̐ gi rnam pas zhing khams de dag tu gshegs par gyur/ ming byang bsreg pa ni/ gson cig dgongs shig rigs kyi bu: phung po lnga yi bud shing la: rgyal ba rigs lnga'i me sbar ro: 'byung ba bzhi yi bud shing la: lha mo bzhi yi me sbar ro: dbang po drug gi bud (328)shing la: byang chub sems kyi me sbar ro: yul rnams drug gi bud shing la: rgyal ba'i sku gsum me sbar ro: sku gsum ye shes lnga ldan du: 'gro ba'i don gnyis 'grub par shog: oṃ badz+ra dz+wa la raṃ dz+wa la raṃ: zhes phung po sbyong thabs sgrib gnyis rnam grol las 'byung bas sreg la sats+tsha gdab bo//
zhes pa'ang dpal chen 'dus pas so///
